OL,3,GNEWSAWriter tried to hold up bank with
OL,4,Abanana
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe author of a book called The Man Who
OL,7,FRobbed A Bank With A Banana demanded
OL,8,Fmoney from cashiers while holding a
OL,9,Fbanana concealed to look like a gun, a
OL,10,Fcourt has heard.
OL,12,FChristopher North, 51, was wearing a
OL,13,Fbalaclava and pointed the piece of
OL,14,Ffruit wrapped in a cloth at bank staff
OL,15,Fin Middlesbrough in January, Teesside
OL,16,FCrown Court heard.
OL,18,FA judge said if it were not for his
OL,19,Fmental illness, North, whose previous
OL,20,Fconvictions included making a bomb
OL,21,Fthreat, could have been jailed for up
OL,22,Fto eight years.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
