OL,5,
OL,6,FBut as he had engaged with treatment
OL,7,Fand medication while on remand, he was
OL,8,Fgiven a suspended sentence. He was
OL,9,Foriginally charged with attempted
OL,10,Frobbery but admitted being a public
OL,11,Fnuisance.
